OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FEarly cloud and rain clearing
OL,6,Faway early this morning. The rest of
OL,7,Fthe day will then be mainly dry with
OL,8,Fgood sunny spells, perhaps a few
OL,9,Fshowers later in north.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA mainly dry evening with
OL,12,Fsunshine. The rest of the night will
OL,13,Fbe generally dry, however a few
OL,14,Fshowers may affect Moray and north
OL,15,FAberdeenshire for a time.
OL,16,
OL,17,CMonday:FAny early showers across
OL,18,Fnorthern areas will clear, leaving a
OL,19,Fbright day with plenty of warm sunny
OL,20,Fspells. Sunshine will turn a little
OL,21,Fhazy at times through the afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
